  "starterCode": "import math\ndef solve(gradients,max_norm):\n    pass",
  "solution": "### 💡 Intuition & Approach\nVectorized, mathematically sound implementation.\n\n### ⚡ Implementation\n```python\nimport math\ndef solve(gradients,max_norm):\n    norm=math.sqrt(sum(v*v for g in gradients for v in g))\n    scale=min(1.0,max_norm/(norm or 1.0))\n    return [[v*scale for v in g] for g in gradients]\n```\n\n### ⏱️ Complexity Analysis\n- **Time Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$\n- **Space Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$",
